      },
      "message": "fix(test): build CuttingRow with plain() in the wire tool tests\n\nPR #2140 added two tests that build a CuttingRow literal with a bare\nWorkMaterial and no step fields. PR #2101 made `material` an Option and\nadded `stepdown` and `stepover`. Each PR built alone; after the two\nmerges the batch build of main failed in camcraft-tools (lib test) and\ncamcraft-app (test wire_tool). Both tests now use CuttingRow::plain and\nkeep their \"EDM conditions\" assertions.\n\nFixes #2244\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
