      "message": "test(kernel): pin the STEP agreement row of fig8.step\n\nPR #2215 added testdata/models/fig8.step without a row in the STEP\nagreement bench, so step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name fails on main.\nThe new row pins the reading: solidcore refuses the file at a pcurve\n(as fillet_corner.step), truck reads it. A per-file test is added.\n\nFixes #2244\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
